# Preserve regional rate-limit enforcement

## Affected sites
- app/src/lib/datafn/client.ts:42 — classifies every `DATAFN_ROUTE_*` error as fallback-worthy.
- packages/api/src/services.ts:177 — enforces the 120 requests/minute subject/workspace limit and emits `DATAFN_ROUTE_RATE_LIMITED`.

## Required outcome
- Surface regional rate-limit and other policy denials to the caller without issuing a canonical retry.
- Retain canonical recovery for failures that genuinely indicate an unavailable or stale regional route.

## Suggested approach
- Replace the prefix match with an explicit allowlist of recoverable route codes and cover `DATAFN_ROUTE_RATE_LIMITED` in `datafn-direct-client.test.ts`.
